<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="en" data-low-data="<%= user?.preferences?.lowData ? 'true' : 'false' %>"><head><meta charset="utf-8"/><meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover" name="viewport"/><meta content="Search common topics or send a support request with the details needed to assist you." name="description"/><meta content="#ff6200" name="theme-color"/><title>Help &amp; Support — Classic Mart</title><link href="/styles.css" rel="stylesheet"/><link href="/storefront-pages.css" rel="stylesheet"/><link href="/shared-shell.css" rel="stylesheet"/><link href="/marketplace-pages.css" rel="stylesheet"/><link href="/info-pages.css" rel="stylesheet"/></head><body class="info-body"><a class="skip-link" href="#mainContent">Skip to content</a><%- include("partials/storefront-header") %><main class="info-main" id="mainContent"><section class="info-hero"><div class="container"><nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" class="catalog-breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span>›</span><strong>Help &amp; Support</strong></nav><span class="info-kicker">How can we help?</span><h1>Help &amp; Support</h1><p>Search common topics or send a support request with the details needed to assist you.</p></div></section><div class="container info-content"><div class="help-layout"><section><div class="faq-grid"><article><h2>Orders</h2><p>Track an order, change delivery details or understand an order status.</p></article><article><h2>Returns</h2><p>Review eligibility, request steps and refund expectations.</p></article><article><h2>Payments</h2><p>Learn about protected checkout and payment troubleshooting.</p></article><article><h2>Seller support</h2><p>Get help with storefront setup, listings and marketplace activity.</p></article></div></section><form action="/support/request" class="info-form support-form" id="helpPageForm" method="post"><h2>Send a support request</h2><input name="_csrf" type="hidden" value="<%= csrfToken %>"/><input name="context" type="hidden" value="help"/><label>Full name<input maxlength="120" minlength="2" name="name" required value="<%= user?.name || '' %>"/></label><label>Email address<input maxlength="254" name="email" required type="email" value="<%= user?.email || '' %>" placeholder="you@example.com"/></label><label>Topic<select name="topic" required><option value="">Choose a topic</option><option value="Order support">Order support</option><option value="Returns and refunds">Returns and refunds</option><option value="Payment issue">Payment issue</option><option value="Seller support">Seller support</option><option value="Account support">Account support</option><option value="Other">Other</option></select></label><label>Order number (optional)<input maxlength="100" name="orderId" placeholder="e.g. ord_..."/></label><label>Message<textarea maxlength="3000" minlength="10" name="message" placeholder="Tell us what happened..." required rows="6"></textarea></label><button type="submit">Send Request</button><p class="form-status" role="status"><%= flash?.message || '' %></p><small>Your request is stored in Classic Mart and enters the country support SLA queue.</small></form></div></div><% if (typeof cmsContent !== 'undefined' && cmsContent) { %><section class="container info-section" style="margin-top:18px"><article style="border:1px solid #dbe4ef;border-radius:18px;padding:18px;background:#fff"><span class="info-kicker">Managed content · v<%= cmsContent.version %></span><h2><%= cmsContent.title %></h2><p style="white-space:pre-wrap"><%= cmsContent.body %></p></article></section><% } %></main><section class="newsletter">
<div class="container newsletter-inner">
<div class="newsletter-message"><span><img alt="" src="/assets/icons/envelope.svg"/></span><div><strong>Stay in the Loop!</strong><small>Get exclusive deals, new arrivals and shopping tips.</small></div></div>
<form class="newsletter-form" data-newsletter-form id="newsletterForm" novalidate>
<label class="sr-only" for="newsletterEmail">Email address</label>
<input autocomplete="email" id="newsletterEmail" maxlength="254" name="email" placeholder="Enter your email address" required type="email"/>
<button type="submit">Subscribe</button>
<p aria-live="polite" class="newsletter-status" data-newsletter-status></p>
</form>
<div class="newsletter-perks"><span><img alt="" src="/assets/icons/percent.svg"/><b>Exclusive Deals</b></span><span><img alt="" src="/assets/icons/gift.svg"/><b>New Arrivals</b></span><span><img alt="" src="/assets/icons/location-dot.svg"/><b>Shopping Tips</b></span></div>
</div>
</section><%- include("partials/storefront-footer") %><div aria-live="polite" class="page-toast" id="pageToast" role="status"></div><script src="/cart-store.js"></script>
<script src="/info-pages.js"></script><script src="/shared-shell.js"></script><script src="/image-fallback.js"></script><script src="/country-switcher.js"></script><script src="/search-tools.js"></script><script src="/newsletter.js"></script></body></html>